# Mandatory policy (this repository)

## 1. Read matching skills with the Read tool

When the task matches a row below, read the full skill file **before** editing files or giving domain guidance:

| Task matches | Read this skill |
|--------------|----------------|
| UoP, B2B, JDG, ryczałt, PKWiU, payroll, ZUS, KUP, brutto/netto, `index.html`, `public/job-rules.json`, calculator UI, i18n, tests | `.cursor/skills/uop-kalkulator/SKILL.md` |
| Git history rewrite, stash, reset, force-push, bulk deletes, large multi-file refactors | `.cursor/skills/agent-workflow/SKILL.md` |

If both rows apply, read both skills before proceeding.

## 2. If you cannot read a file

Say so explicitly and ask the user. Do **not** improvise without the skill text.

## 3. Domain skill is mandatory for calculator work

`uop-kalkulator` skill is required — not optional — for any edit to `index.html`, `public/job-rules.json`, or tax/payroll calculations.
